<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80949" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπτ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέσσω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>able to digest</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. εἶναι τῆς τροφῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					766a32
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχειν τὴν κοιλίαν . .
				πεπτικωτάτην</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				749b24
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις π.</span>
			<i>digestive</i> power, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>promoting digestion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				677b32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Long.</u>
				466b32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Lass.</u>
				16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.2.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Xenocr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				2.58.98
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					3.31
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					11.779
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>promoting concoction</i>, hence of the male seed, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπέρμα π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Zeno Stoic.
					1.36
				</span></i>
			.</div>
